		{"id":"g-23cae583fd75c7","x":720,"y":0,"width":1200,"height":189,"type":"text","text":"# Areas\nThe state of each area of khora's design: decided, open, and where it is written.\n\nColours: red = needs a person now · orange = header and Reading · yellow = live · purple = Spec, kinds and processes.\n\nRendered 2026-11-17 by agent:claude-opus-5-5","color":"2"},
		{"id":"g-510675bd9c99f9","x":720,"y":309,"width":760,"height":208,"type":"text","text":"## Reading · 2026-11-17\n- First render. The vault has no Decisions or Questions yet, so every Area is empty.\n- Eight transcripts are waiting for Call Ingestion (see the Stale canvas). Until they are ingested, no document can be traced.\n- **Needs a person:** decide how transcripts are shared, now that they stay out of git, before the first ingestion.","color":"2"},
