		{"id":"spec","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":560,"height":755,"color":"6","text":"## Spec · Areas\n*Edit this card to change what the canvas shows. Agents re-render everything else from it via [[Render Canvas v1.0.0]].*\n\n**Purpose.** One place to see the state of each area of khora's design: what is decided, what is open, and which documents carry it.\n\n**For each Area**, one labelled group, in the order Design, Log, Surfaces, Surface logic, Scopes, Runtime, Behaviors, Security, Product, Kit:\n- live `decisions` card for the Area (active Decisions, newest first, max 8);\n- live `questions` card for the Area (open Questions with their lean);\n- a card listing the documents whose `areas` frontmatter names the Area, as links;\n- a card listing open issues that link the Area's Decisions (`gh issue list`), or saying there are none.\n\n**Reading card** at the top: which Areas moved since the last render, which have Decisions no document carries yet (from the stale report), and the one thing that most needs a person.\n\n**Edges:** none.\n\n**Context:** `khora-canvas graph`; `areas` frontmatter in docs/ and CLAUDE.md; `bash .claude/scripts/khora-stale --stdout`; `gh issue list --state open`.\n\n**Triggers:** after each ingestion pull request is merged; after Update View; at the weekly's Observe; on request.\n\nKinds: Area v1.0.0, Decision v1.0.0, Question v1.0.0\n"}
	],
